{"id":592,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;根据《中北大学大学生综合素质测评办法（修订）》（校学【2021】10号）、《航空宇航学院本科生综合素质测评实施细则》，经学院动员、班级评议、班级公示、学院审核，现对本科生2025-2026学年综合素质测评专业排名进行公示，请查看附件名单。</p><p>公示时间为9月18日— 9月20日，凡对以上结果有异议者，请及时向学生科（航空宇航学院办公大楼301办公室）反映。</p><p>联 系 人：李老师</p><p>联系电话：0351-3922781</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\" data_ue_src=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\"><a href=\"/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1855776123&wbfileid=A38801970A7AFFE2272950F1AB4CE9CC\">飞行器设计与工程综合素质测评专业排名.zip</a></p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\" data_ue_src=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\"><a href=\"/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1855776123&wbfileid=EF2EC6AC75EFF04B470642A13C69027A\">工程力学综合素质测评专业排名.zip</a></p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\" data_ue_src=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\"><a href=\"/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1855776123&wbfileid=EA1B5A7C93C4F0BA3B6102452624C3F7\">飞行器制造工程综合素质测评专业排名.zip</a></p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\" data_ue_src=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/system/resource/images/fileTypeImages/icon_rar.gif\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/system/resource